# Claude Code: ignore local session state (directives, plans, todos),
# but DO track committed skills and this repo's local hook policy.
.claude/**
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
.claude/hooks/**/__pycache__/
.claude/hooks/**/*.pyc
.codex/hooks/**/__pycache__/
.codex/hooks/**/*.pyc
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
node_modules/

# Campaign scratch space. Campaign ARTIFACTS (*.patch, *-artifact.json,
# *-review-results.json) are deliberately tracked as the campaign's record — see the
# 33 files already under dev/campaigns/. Its sandboxes/ are not: they are per-agent git
# worktrees, measured at 8.6 GB for the stringly-domain-types campaign alone, and they
# were sitting untracked and un-ignored where a single `git add .` would have tried to
# commit the lot. Regenerable by definition, so they must never enter history.
dev/campaigns/*/sandboxes/
